<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31920" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκοχ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <i><span class="en">
			Arc.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσδοκά</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			5(2).6.40
		</span></i> :—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>receiving
				fromor at the hands of another, succession,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πομποῦ πυρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					299
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκδοχαῖς ἐπιφέρει θεὸς κακόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					866
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ποιεῖσθαι πολέμου</span> to
				<i>continue</i> the war, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				2.30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>receiving, containing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄμβρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					5.4.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. Paul. Aeg.<i><span class="en">
				6.106
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>taking</i> or <i>understanding in a certain sense,
				interpretation,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ποιεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					3.29.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>UPZ</u>
				110.86
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ὧν ἦν λαμβάνειν ἐκδοχὴν ὅτι..</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					22.7.6
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				557.18
			</span></i> (Magn.Mae., <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				13.100
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσδοκία, κρίσεως</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Hebr.</u>
				10.27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδοχή</span>
			, <i>recognition</i> for services rendered, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(5).722.8
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Andros</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			<i>giving of security,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προειδὼς ἀσφαλῆ τὴν ἐ. οὖσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PSI</u>
					4.349
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>VI.</b>
			<i>contract,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				5(2)
			</span></i>.l.c.</div>
